      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LAND AND POSSIBLE SITE FOR SALE\r\nCIRCA 2.28 ACRES\r\nARDNACULLA NORTH, ENNISTYMON,CO. CLARE.\r\n\r\n\r\nCONTAINED IN FOLIO CE19943F.\r\n\r\nVIEWINGS STRICTLY BY ADVANCE APPOINTMENT WITH SOLE AGENT STREETS AHEAD PROPERTIES\r\n\r\nPROPERTY LICENCE NO 003178\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION:\r\n\r\nStreets Ahead Properties are delighted to bring to the market this fantastic opportunity to acquire a parcel of land in the Ennistymon area, Co. Clare, with potential for a residential site, subject to the necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nThe land enjoys a peaceful rural setting while being conveniently located close to the amenities and services of Ennistymon town. The surrounding area offers beautiful countryside, with the West Clare coastline and popular destinations such as Lahinch and the Cliffs of Moher within easy reach.\r\nThe property may appeal to those looking to create a home in a desirable part of County Clare, or to purchasers seeking a land investment opportunity.\r\n\r\nLocated on a rural road 500m from the N85. The adjacent property has an Eircode, V95 AXT9*for directional purposes only*.   \r\n\r\nLahinch is easily accessible in 10 minutes from the property, famous for its sandy beach, Promenade walk and 18 hole Championship golf course which the Irish Open was held 2019. There is also a newly refurbished Leisure Centre just recently reopened to the public and includes state-of-the-art gym and swimming pool."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tAttractive countryside setting\r\n•\tAll facilities close by\r\n•\tConvenient to Ennistymon town and local amenities\r\n•\tClose to Lahinch and the West Clare coastline\r\n•\tPotential residential site, subject to planning permission\r\n•\t2.28 acres \r\n•\tEnnis is approximately 30–35 minutes by car and Shannon airport 45-50 minutes."
      }
    ],
